= Wave 1: Mechanics Mods

These mods deepen driving, fuel management, and police response. All require ScriptHookV.

== Mod Entry Format

- *Category:* Mechanics
- *Version:* Compatible with GTA V Enhanced 1.0.1158.13
- *Dependencies:* Required tools or mods
- *Install path:* Where files go
- *System Impact:* What gameplay system changes
- *Installation:* Special steps

== Driving

=== #link("https://www.gta5-mods.com/vehicles/drive-v-realistic-driving-car-handling")[Drive V]
- *Category:* Mechanics (vehicle handling / damage)
- *Author:* PermissionToLand
- *Version:* latest (see source)
- *Dependencies:* ScriptHookV
- *Install path:* Game root (`.asi` / scripts)
- *System Impact:* Realistic handling, deformation, and damage
- *Installation:* Install per the page's instructions (script + handling files).

The actively maintained successor to *Realistic Driving V* (abandoned in 2018). Replaces vanilla vehicle handling with realistic physics — weight transfer, reduced grip, and much more punishing deformation. Makes every crash and getaway feel earned.

=== #link("https://www.gta5-mods.com/scripts/manual-transmission-ikt")[Manual Transmission]
- *Category:* Mechanics (driving)
- *Author:* ikt
- *Version:* latest (see source)
- *Dependencies:* ScriptHookV
- *Install path:* Game root (`Gears.asi`)
- *System Impact:* Full manual transmission, clutch, wheel support
- *Installation:* Copy `Gears.asi` to the root; configure in the in-game menu.

Adds manual sequential and H-pattern shifting with a working clutch, plus steering-wheel support (DirectInput + force feedback), launch control, and traction/stability control. Development has moved to the author's Patreon; the GTA5-Mods download remains the install point.

== Survival

=== #link("https://www.gta5-mods.com/scripts/simple-fuel")[Simple Fuel]
- *Category:* Mechanics (economy / survival)
- *Author:* LeFix
- *Version:* 1.1.7 (+ community patches)
- *Dependencies:* ScriptHookV, ScriptHookVDotNet
- *Install path:* `/scripts/` (ScriptHookVDotNet)
- *System Impact:* Fuel consumption and refuelling
- *Installation:* Drop the script into `/scripts/`; configure via the `.ini`.

Vehicles consume fuel, and you must refuel at stations or with jerry cans — running out strands you on the roadside. The original 1.1.7 is unmaintained; if it errors on current builds, use the community patches (1.1.8/1.1.9) linked in the page's comments.

== Police & Emergency

=== #link("https://www.lcpdfr.com/downloads/gta5mods/misc/9266-rebalanced-dispatch-enhanced/")[Rebalanced Dispatch Enhanced (RDE)]
- *Category:* Mechanics (police / emergency services)
- *Author:* Yard1 & team (rebalanced community release)
- *Version:* 4.1.2+ (see source)
- *Dependencies:* CodeWalker (mods folder), ScriptHookVDotNet Enhanced
- *Install path:* `/mods/` (via CodeWalker)
- *System Impact:* Overhauls police, military, and emergency dispatch
- *Installation:* Large install — follow the page's guide; use the `mods` folder.

The continuation of *Realism Dispatch Enhanced*: lore-friendly police/military/emergency vehicles, realistic AI and dispatch behaviour, and region-correct agencies. Requires an up-to-date `gameconfig.xml`, ScriptHookV, and ScriptHookVDotNet Enhanced.

